  "goodToKnow": "Die Radtour is a bike ride or cycling tour: eine Radtour machen. Germany has a dense network of long-distance cycle routes, such as the Elberadweg, the Donauradweg and the Bodensee-Radweg around Lake Constance. Many people now ride E-Bikes, technically called Pedelecs. Der Radweg is a cycle path, and die Fahrradstraße a street where bikes have priority. Plural: die Radtouren."
